Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see this season's new anime?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything grab your interest?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.55,0:00:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this game, that's for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly, I am no match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.21,Game,,0,0,0,,{\pos(990,925)}{\fad(100,100)}Five in a row - Laojun wins
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the game, Emperor Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that the Sky Pearl was stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are your spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sent them up the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:01:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The nearby hills are not suitable for Bidiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we will go deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we taking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere far from people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't other animals hurt him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Xiaohei is the only one who can catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Bidiu fond of wood?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he eats up the whole forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.51,0:01:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Trees are living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They become wood when they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu won't eat living trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:46.15,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1591,381)}Deep in the Mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, today's weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Typhoon "Show Joy" is approaching the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.51,0:01:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to take the laundry in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.91,0:01:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not confirmed as of now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:01:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely in two episodes' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I go tell the other households.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,From here we have to go by foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.29,0:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like no one's been around here for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this has been Grandpa's wood gathering trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So many fairies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not shy of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The villagers don't hurt them, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:02:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We are getting along with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond this rock lies their world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.41,0:03:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What a huge rock...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who put it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go in there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:32.27,Animal,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You are free now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go eating people's houses again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:38.86,Animal,,0,0,0,,Come?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:42.68,Animal,,0,0,0,,Race to the top?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:43.32,Animal,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.59,0:03:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why... Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't he be lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.89,0:04:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he starves?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.84,0:04:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.41,0:04:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he think about us sometimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.81,0:04:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky turned quite dark...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The forecast said a big storm is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't Bidiu be in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Xiaobai in the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You feel it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A strong spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wish to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.17,0:05:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the king of fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you find this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've simply followed the strongest aura around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange... Xiaohei's aura is quite weak right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:07.74,Strongest,,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,440)}{\fr(90)\fs(100)}The Strongest Around
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:07.90,Strongest,,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,440)}{\fr(90)\fs(100)}The Strongest Around
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.99,0:06:08.20,Strongest,,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,440)}{\fr(90)\fs(100)}The Strongest Around
