Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't do it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the episode is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I see I'm no match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask Master Lao. He knows everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.53,Animal,,0,0,0,,They sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:18.52,Title 2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1544,538)}Diting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something before you became the master's disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't trust me, I'll go to him with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can meet him whenever you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My spirit body...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:34.57,Animal,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder you could steal the Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Xiaohei too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:07:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At worst I'll reveal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You still refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Lao suggested it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this all you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.69,0:08:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm playing it slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My vegetables!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My fruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:24.00,Strongest,,0,0,0,,{\pos(875,200)}{\frz(-20)\fs(25)}Hidden\NMoney
Dialogue: -1000,0:08:23.13,0:08:24.00,BG_Moneypot,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 925.22 144.35 l 913.74 170.78 906.09 193.74 901.22 216.7 901.57 237.91 858.09 223.65 850.78 196.87 854.61 163.48 864.7 147.83 875.48 134.96 900.87 137.74{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How delectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the right time to mock me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're over here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.41,0:08:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.14,0:08:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he holding back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not fighting seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to be at advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:08:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a bet that-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I sought shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pausing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I hate rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop a fight halfway!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We can fight inside as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad for your health to stand in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax and have some tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it end up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How can the rain fall so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Bidiu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be, he's safe where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not "ice boy".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of thunder?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:09:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,6 miles away a human got trapped under a collapsed building.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In which direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A pavilion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I must help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look like you're evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting is a mythical spirit beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you must be a good spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But why did you attack Gen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.14,0:10:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not afraid, knowing what I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.81,0:10:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not. Gen is a spirit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So you already knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not afraid of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I be? He's my cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So already know about-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice breaking fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No time for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the person?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he washed away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuanli.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you make the ice breaking fire to test me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.69,0:11:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have rescued the human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No secret is safe from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you find it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We simply know each other too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you reveal yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I live in seclusion now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Lao's magical sound transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he that modern?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.42,0:11:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.51,0:11:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.74,0:11:56.80,Animal,,0,0,0,,Meow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:11:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Lao wants to see you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not after me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No. It's about the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He finally realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not too sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We will see when we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.33,0:12:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So you guys are friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we were just teasing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed quite serious to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.71,0:12:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you were hit so hard you flew away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:30.93,Animal,,0,0,0,,You were after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:32.26,Animal,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.67,0:12:33.61,Animal,,0,0,0,,All for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:35.34,Animal,,0,0,0,,I am a victim as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're going to meet an immortal...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Lao will be glad to have company.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I take Xiaohei too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:52.27,Animal,,0,0,0,,No need to tell her why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And when can we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's survive tonight first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:12:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped at last...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But the flood won't go away for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like this every year, we're used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go to Uncle San's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please get Master Lao's sign for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You like him that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:14:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.65,0:14:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:03.78,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1700,0)}{\pos(470,705)}Master Lao
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've taken a ride if I'd known...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Master Lao the philosopher Laojun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He was based off of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.51,0:15:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not exactly like in the legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.89,0:15:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does he live?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.69,0:15:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.31,0:16:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Lao's spirit realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Blue Creek Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky is so white!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this where the immortal lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:17:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like where an immortal lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,More like an ancient town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so quiet here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone living here at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's been here for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a beautiful place...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Lao will be glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.52,0:17:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we leave the town now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Starry Night Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Starry Light Lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:17:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:17:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How come it's night here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.67,0:18:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no real day or night here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all controlled by Master Lao.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see that mountain ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.49,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Mount Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Lao lives on the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.81,0:18:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two cliffs are statues!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the "Got a Light?" cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It depicts the chance meeting of Master Lao and Fairy Qingning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How romantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Books everywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Lao hasn't left this place for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's an otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's he been doing for 30 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's watching anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You have finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuanli!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare occasion you come to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.35,0:19:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Laojun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a kid to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my power-save mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your voice doesn't fit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.57,0:19:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My voice is just how I like it~!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must maintain the image of a venerable wise man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you ever go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.09,0:19:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have sworn not to leave this place for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Many years ago, a certain tragic event...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, would you please sign this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Claim for damages caused by fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's... not what it seems like!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just talk about why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go to the inner room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai, wait for us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:19:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for causing you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting, it's your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,None of my damn business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're so polite...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.10,0:20:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then say it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,400 years ago I placed\Nthe Sky Pearl on top of the tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.63,0:20:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and swore that if someone can steal it, they can take it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,or bring it back,\Nand I'll grant them a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did I chase him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:28.01,Animal,,0,0,0,,Then why did he chase me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot about my vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.47,0:20:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As the only one who could steal it in 400 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you must be a wielder of great skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You were careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, it couldn't have been easy for you to escape Diting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.62,0:20:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do you choose the Pearl or the wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Can they really sense it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Diting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:20:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can defeat him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You just do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's very fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,no one can stop us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all otaku stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.33,0:21:32.71,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.33,0:21:32.71,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:37.45,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:37.45,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:42.15,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:42.15,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:48.35,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:48.35,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:54.50,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:54.50,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:59.30,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:59.30,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:03.98,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:03.98,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.98,0:22:10.50,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.98,0:22:10.50,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:21.82,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:21.82,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.82,0:22:27.24,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.82,0:22:27.24,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:32.28,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:32.28,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:43.51,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:43.51,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.51,0:22:49.06,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.51,0:22:49.06,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:55.90,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:55.90,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
